01:01:25.000 --> 01:01:36.490
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia, who has been obsessed lately-- obsessed, I tell you-- watching the Israeli edition of Sesame Street. He especially loves this one character on the show who is always asking--
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他最近着迷了——我告诉你，着迷了——看以色列版的《芝麻街》。他特别喜欢那个节目里总是问的一个角色——

01:01:36.490 --> 01:01:38.430
<v Moti Naftali>"Don't you have any cookies?"
<v Moti Naftali>“没有饼干吗？”

01:01:38.430 --> 01:01:44.630
